#: scenario8:scenario8_1E71D58A_55DC_44D1_93BE_5C4E4AE92DAA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 507efa10bbef9a6274f6434996e59d8a581ae1148ef0ccc24d84dc08fb72f5f4
