#: scenario8:scenario8_7AD4545B_43E2_48BB_83DC_EA12AA8AC13D
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c07732cce33de24d8dd0203eb663e18bc836f33a898c94258d2fb8a8a0609284
